---
name: progress
type: registry:ui
title: Progress
description: Displays an indicator showing the completion progress of a task, typically displayed as a progress bar.
dependencies:
  - bits-ui
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/progress/progress.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/progress/progress.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/progress/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/progress/index.ts"
---

Use progress for determinate task completion. Pass `value` and optional `max` (default 100).

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { Progress } from '~/components/progress';
</script>

<Progress value={66} max={100} class="w-[60%]" />
```
